      "description": "Learners who reached each stage, all cohorts: enrolled \u2192 visited the course \u2192 week-4 topic quiz \u2192 Capstone 1 passed \u2192 exam passed \u2192 certificate \u2192 course complete \u2192 job (graduate survey, Phase 2)."
